| WS/ENet transport (client) | `docs/client-protocol/enet.md` (primary), `docs/client-protocol/realtime.md`, `internal/delivery/ws/README.md`, `internal/delivery/enet/README.md` |
| Env, `LoadFromEnv`, new module `*Config` | `internal/adapter/config/README.md`, module README, [.cursor/rules/config.mdc](config.mdc) |
