| HTTP limits, `HTTPLimitsConfig`, `port/httplimits.Limits` | `internal/adapter/httplimits/README.md`, `internal/port/httplimits`, `internal/delivery/http/README.md` |
| `ErrRoomsLimitReached` | `internal/domain/README.md`, `internal/delivery/http/README.md` |
| Ticket layout (kind/fields), Claims, ValidateNickName, `AdmissionConfig` | `internal/adapter/admission/README.md`, `internal/domain/README.md`, `docs/client-protocol/{realtime,enet,http,errors,state-sync}.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, `GLOSSARY.md` |
| Reservation slots | `internal/adapter/reservation/README.md` |
| Room, Peer, lifecycle, Replace | `internal/adapter/realtime/README.md` |
| StateRoomPolicy, master, ticks | `internal/adapter/realtime/policy/state/README.md`, `docs/client-protocol/state-sync.md` |
